window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>There is nothing more dangerous than a secret….<br> It is how the powerful survive. <br> They spin their influence in the shadows as their sins corrupt the innocent. <br> And I am one of them. <br> The elite. <br> The chosen. </p> <p>It is my inherited fate to claim a place among one of the most secret societies of them all… <br> The Order of the Silver Ghost. <br> It is her fate to be my sacrifice on the altar of wealth and seduction of riches. <br> Tonight, my belle of the ball will dance with the devil and by morning, I will have broken her. <br> For my initiation is a ritual steeped in a dark and twisted tradition of elegant sins. <br> As I said, secrets are dangerous…. <br> But then again, so is love. </p>"; 
